# brightnessctl — built FROM SOURCE via a qforge-owned PKGBUILD (packages/brightnessctl/PKGBUILD).
# It is an Arch [extra] package but absent from the pinned holo aarch64 snapshot (`make relock`
# failed with "target not found: brightnessctl"), so there is no repo row to resolve. Same "local
# PKGBUILD" form as packages/f3/source.pin.
#
# Why: it is OpenGamepadUI's only usable backlight provider — core/global/display_manager.gd picks
# it when `which brightnessctl` succeeds (the alternative is a SteamOS helper we do not ship), and
# without one the brightness slider is absent. See the PKGBUILD for the build flags.
#
# Version: 0.5.1, upstream's latest release (2020-02-02) and what Arch ships.
#
# Fields (see packages/README.md):
#   name           pkgname (must match the PKGBUILD); also the work/ build-dir + repo entry
#   pkgbuild_local path (relative to this dir) to the checked-in PKGBUILD to build
#   pkgrel_suffix  numeric suffix appended to the PKGBUILD's pkgrel so pacman prefers our build
name: brightnessctl
pkgbuild_local: PKGBUILD
pkgrel_suffix: 1
